<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Far below the storm of doubt upon the world is beating,</l><l>Sons of men in battle long the enemy withstand;</l><l>Safe am I within the castle of God’s word retreating,</l><l>Nothing then can reach me, ’tis Beulah Land.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Let the stormy breezes blow, their cry cannot alarm me,</l><l>I am safely sheltered here, protected by God’s hand;</l><l>Here the sun is always shining, here there’s naught can harm me,</l><l>I am safe forever in Beulah Land.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Viewing here the works of God, I sink in contemplation,</l><l>Hearing now His blessed voice, I see the way is planned;</l><l>Dwelling in the spirit, here I learn of full salvation,</l><l>Gladly will I tarry in Beulah Land.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
